real-time tracking and rendering.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-XRC26\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/xr-curve-26\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_xr-curve-26.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/xr-curve-26\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.6mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1200 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the XR Curve 2.6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The XR Curve 2.6 has a fine pixel pitch of 2.6mm, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing in XR volumes and broadcast environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What curve radius options does the XR Curve 2.6 support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports flexible curvature from 500mm to 5000mm radius, allowing both concave and convex configurations to create immersive wrap-around displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How easy is the installation and maintenance of this LED panel?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is streamlined with a quick-lock system and magnetic front-service modules, enabling rapid setup and fast front access for maintenance without dismantling the structure.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What refresh rate does the XR Curve 2.6 support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It offers a high refresh rate of 7680Hz, ensuring flicker-free and smooth visuals even for high frame rate broadcasting and virtual production.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How durable and lightweight is the XR Curve 2.6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each panel weighs 12kg, balancing portability with durability, suitable for both permanent studios and temporary installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the XR Curve 2.6 compatible with popular virtual production software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it integrates seamlessly with software like disguise and Pixotope, supporting real-time tracking and rendering for immersive XR volume experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty packages, typically covering defects and performance issues, along with dedicated technical support to ensure optimal operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the XR Curve 2.6 compare to flat LED panels in virtual production?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat panels, the XR Curve 2.6\\u2019s curved design enables wrap-around immersive environments that enhance realism and viewer engagement in virtual sets and automotive reveals.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"XR Curve 2.6\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/xr-curve-26\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>XR Curve 2.6</h1><p>Explore XR Curve 2.6 curved LED display from Brightluxx in Dubai. Enhance your venue’s ambiance. Request a free quote in the UAE today!</p><p><strong>Curved LED volume for wrap-around virtual production.</strong></p><p>Curved LED panel system for building wrap-around XR volumes. Concave and convex configurations from 500mm to 5000mm radius. Magnetic front-service modules enable rapid setup and striking. Integrated with disguise and Pixotope for real-time tracking and rendering.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the XR Curve 2.6?</h3><p>The XR Curve 2.6 has a fine pixel pitch of 2.6mm, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing in XR volumes and broadcast environments.</p><h3>What curve radius options does the XR Curve 2.6 support?</h3><p>It supports flexible curvature from 500mm to 5000mm radius, allowing both concave and convex configurations to create immersive wrap-around displays.</p><h3>How easy is the installation and maintenance of this LED panel?</h3><p>Installation is streamlined with a quick-lock system and magnetic front-service modules, enabling rapid setup and fast front access for maintenance without dismantling the structure.</p><h3>What refresh rate does the XR Curve 2.6 support?</h3><p>It offers a high refresh rate of 7680Hz, ensuring flicker-free and smooth visuals even for high frame rate broadcasting and virtual production.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js