ars Extended Available\"}]}10:T9a9,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the XR Curve 2.6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The XR Curve 2.6 has a fine pixel pitch of 2.6mm, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing in XR volumes and broadcast environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What curve radius options does the XR Curve 2.6 support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports flexible curvature from 500mm to 5000mm radius, allowing both concave and convex configurations to create immersive wrap-around displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How easy is the installation and maintenance of this LED panel?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is streamlined with a quick-lock system and magnetic front-service modules, enabling rapid setup and fast front access for maintenance without dismantling the structure.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What refresh rate does the XR Curve 2.6 support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It offers a high refresh rate of 7680Hz, ensuring flicker-free and smooth visuals even for high frame rate broadcasting and virtual production.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How durable and lightweight is the XR Curve 2.6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each panel weighs 12kg, balancing portability with durability, suitable for both permanent studios and temporary installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the XR Curve 2.6 compatible with popular virtual production software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it integrates seamlessly with software like disguise and Pixotope, supporting real-time tracking and rendering for immersive XR volume experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty packages, typically covering defects and performance issues, along with dedicated technical support to ensure optimal operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the XR Curve 2.6 compare to flat LED panels in virtual production?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat panels, the XR Curve 2.6\\u2019s curved design enables wrap-around immersive environments that enhance realism and viewer engagement in virtual sets and automotive reveals.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"XR Curve 2.6\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/xr-curve-26\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \